DEPENDENCIES NOT INCLUDED HERE

The eight Lean files under rh-program/lean/ are additions to, and import from, the Zeta23
library, which is Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC, released under the Apache License 2.0,
and published at https://github.com/anthropics/zeta-23-lean. Those files contain no code
from that library and are not part of its release. Zeta23 is not redistributed here.

Zeta23 in turn depends on Lean 4 and mathlib4 with its standard dependency set, fetched by
the build tool from their public repositories at the revisions Zeta23 pins. None of those
is included here either.

The paper this program builds on, L. Alpoge and R. Furman, "More than two thirds of the
zeros of the Riemann zeta function lie on the critical line" (2026), is arXiv:2608.13637 and
is not redistributed here.

The program's working library of fetched third-party literature (rh-program/fetched*/) is
copyrighted material belonging to its respective publishers and is deliberately excluded
from this repository. Nothing in any paper here depends on it; every external claim is
cited to its published source.
